{"schemaVersion":1,"id":356,"sections":[{"id":"815001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20587],"start":0,"count":43},{"id":"815001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20588],"start":43,"count":25}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:1","scriptId":20587,"text":"因为世界各地的空袭事件越来越多，所以大部分的军事设施都开始着手建立防空战线。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:2","scriptId":20587,"text":"死水也不例外——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:3","scriptId":20587,"text":"“防空系统的研究进行的如何了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:4","scriptId":20587,"text":"“目前‘RHO屋’已经进入二次测试阶段了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:5","scriptId":20587,"text":"“就是你之前说的绝对领空封锁？那东西真的可靠吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:6","scriptId":20587,"text":"维多利亚从来不怀疑波西娅的能力，但她之所以会这样问完全是因为这次的这个系统并不是完全由波西娅提供的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:7","scriptId":20587,"text":"“还在担心的旅行者的问题？虽然这个柔我是不怎么熟悉，但既然是兰布达介绍的，所以我觉得还是可以去相信一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:8","scriptId":20587,"text":"“既然你这么说，那我也不多说什么了，快点部署好，我已经不想再听到空袭警报了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:10","scriptId":20587,"text":"由旅行者柔所提供的名为“RHO屋”的系统开启后拥有绝大的空间封锁能力，在一定时间内可以完全隔绝来自空中的威胁。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:11","scriptId":20587,"text":"死水正在加紧研究这个部署，不过在另一处基地里，这个RHO屋系统已经正式投入使用了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:13","scriptId":20587,"text":"特别空勤队基地——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:14","scriptId":20587,"text":"“真是没想到旅行者会光临我们这里……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:15","scriptId":20587,"text":"在特勤空勤队基地的入口处，正站着两名旅行者。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:16","scriptId":20587,"text":"说是站着倒也不是十分贴切，因为其中一名旅行者是坐在一个形似飞盘的浮空轮上，在离开地面半米高的地方上下浮动着。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:17","scriptId":20587,"text":"这位坐在浮空轮上的旅行者名叫柔，而她身边的另一位则是华尔兹中队熟识的兰布达。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:18","scriptId":20587,"text":"“怎么样，RHO屋已经正常运作了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:19","scriptId":20587,"text":"兰布达完全无视杵在一边的亚当斯，对着我说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":56,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:20","scriptId":20587,"text":"“是的，完全的空域封锁还真是厉害，这下终于可以不用担心那些飞行战车兽了，真是太感谢了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:21","scriptId":20587,"text":"“嗯，不过我觉得更应该感谢的是柔。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:22","scriptId":20587,"text":"“是啊，谢谢你，柔。还特地跑来进行系统检查。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:23","scriptId":20587,"text":"我向着对着坐在浮空轮上的柔道了谢。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:24","scriptId":20587,"text":"“哼，不用太过感谢，我并不想和你们有过多的交集，这是阿尔库涅大人对你们的恩赐，要感谢就感谢阿尔库涅大人吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1124,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:25","scriptId":20587,"text":"柔的语气中带着一丝轻蔑，不过因为兰布达在场的关系她好像已经非常克制了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1124,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:26","scriptId":20587,"text":"“那可真是谢谢艾丽莎了，虽然她本人不在这里，希望你们回去之后能转达给她。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1124,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:27","scriptId":20587,"text":"“跪下然后俯首贴地的感谢才对吧，不然也太轻描淡写了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1124,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:28","scriptId":20587,"text":"“好了，柔，这个人类并不是我们的奴隶，平等对待并不是什么难事。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1124,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:29","scriptId":20587,"text":"“你的思想很危险啊，兰布达。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1124,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:30","scriptId":20587,"text":"对柔的告诫，兰布达表现出了一种无视的态度。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1124,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:31","scriptId":20587,"text":"“既然已经确认过RHO屋系统运转正常，那我们也该告辞了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1124,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:32","scriptId":20587,"text":"“还真是你一贯的风格啊，那我也不多说什么了。走好，一路顺风。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:33","scriptId":20587,"text":"“后会有期。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:34","scriptId":20587,"text":"兰布达还是一如既往的效率第一，但或许兰布达并没有察觉到自己的一些细微变化。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":4,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:36","scriptId":20587,"text":"接着兰布达便使用她的传送能力和柔一起消失在了白光之中。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:37","scriptId":20587,"text":"“果然是传奇人物，见到旅行者也面不改色啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:38","scriptId":20587,"text":"“如果你在一个身边有好几个旅行者的环境里待上很长一段时间，那你也能像我一样。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:39","scriptId":20587,"text":"“旅行者还真是非常蔑视人类呢，那个柔的态度完全就是不把人类放在眼里。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:40","scriptId":20587,"text":"“没有兵刃相向就不错了，兰布达算是阿尔库涅的派系，不会对我们人类造成危害，总之尽我们所能好好相处就是了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:41","scriptId":20587,"text":"“但威胁始终是威胁，这种自大的外来者，早晚会搬起石头砸自己的脚。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:42","scriptId":20587,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:43","scriptId":20587,"text":"和亚当斯接触多了也就知道他为什么要戒备旅行者——亚当斯以前所在的部队在突袭行动中受到重创，而发动突袭行动的人便是上位旅行者泰莱塔。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:44","scriptId":20587,"text":"知道仇恨这东西不会轻易冰释，所以我也就没有继续这个话题。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:45","scriptId":20587,"text":"“昨天的报告我刚打算给你看来着。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1111,"speaker":"亚当斯·哈柏林","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"815001-PROLOGUE:20587:46","scriptId":20587,"text":"“那就回办公室吧，站在外面看公文可不太合适。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-132.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:1","scriptId":20588,"text":"兰布达和柔从白光中走了出来，而周围的环境已经完全变了一幅模样。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:2","scriptId":20588,"text":"长距离传送消耗比较大，如果不是特别紧急的情况，兰布达都会选择像这样进行短途的连续传送，这样更有效率。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1111,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:3","scriptId":20588,"text":"“怎么样？检查下来有什么发现吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:4","scriptId":20588,"text":"兰布达所指的检查便是她们给死水和特别空勤队安装的“RHO屋系统”。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:5","scriptId":20588,"text":"“特别空勤队的RHO屋里没有留下特别的记录，大都是飞行战车兽的袭击数据，没有异常。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:6","scriptId":20588,"text":"柔甩了甩手，从她失望的神色上来看，应该没有达到她们想要的目标。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:7","scriptId":20588,"text":"“看来还得跑一次波西娅那边，希望死水那边能有点收获吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:8","scriptId":20588,"text":"兰布达坐在一块凸起的岩石上稍作休息。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:9","scriptId":20588,"text":"“这颗星球上真的有除了我们以外的星外势力吗？总觉得有些无用功啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:10","scriptId":20588,"text":"“确实不好说，菲的报告总有那么点浮夸成分，特别是她那轻佻的个性容易小题大做。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:11","scriptId":20588,"text":"“如果她能带回一些证据的话，那又另当别论了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:12","scriptId":20588,"text":"“也是，如果带回来一些残骸或者尸体什么的，我们就能开始进行分析了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:13","scriptId":20588,"text":"“不过她是战斗配属，不能要求和我们搞研究的一样用探求的精神看待问题，她也没那意识。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:14","scriptId":20588,"text":"“既然阿尔库涅大人已经下达了调查命令，我们尽力去做就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:15","scriptId":20588,"text":"兰布达休息片刻之后，向柔示意要发动下一次传送，不过这时候柔提了个问题。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:16","scriptId":20588,"text":"“呐，兰布达，你有没有想过，如果真发现了除我们以外的星外势力，那地球接下来会变成什么样子？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:17","scriptId":20588,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:18","scriptId":20588,"text":"“不好说，如果只是碰巧经过的那应该不会有什么问题，最多就是一些侦查部队。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:19","scriptId":20588,"text":"“那如果是侵略性质的侦查呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:20","scriptId":20588,"text":"“这恐怕会让局面变得非常混乱，真的演变成那样的话就要看上位的大人们怎么决断了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:21","scriptId":20588,"text":"“也是，我们想那么多好像也没什么意义，走吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:22","scriptId":20588,"text":"“只是考虑可能性并没有什么坏处，至少遇到紧急事态不会措手不及。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:23","scriptId":20588,"text":"“真是会说话，你也开始变得圆滑了啊，我还以为你永远都是那个一成不变的兰布达呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:24","scriptId":20588,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"815001-EPILOGUE:20588:25","scriptId":20588,"text":"一道白光又再度升空。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":56,"right":1124,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
